      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS take great pleasure in presenting this absolutely fantastic three-bedroom / three-bathroom duplex apartment to the market within the prestigious Carrigmore development, Citywest. The phrase 'location, location, location' immediately springs to mind as this magnificent development is ideally positioned less than five minutes' walk from the Luas and also within a mere stone's throw you will find the Citywest Shopping Centre, choice of bus routes giving easy access to the City Centre and a host of major road networks.\r\n\r\nBright, airy and most spacious internal living accommodation of c. 110 sqm comprises of entrance hallway with guest bathroom, modern fully fitted kitchen, extra-large open plan living/dining and beautiful light filled sunroom to the rear. On the first floor you have three double bedrooms (one master ensuite) with built in wardrobes and main family bathroom. A door from the sun room leads onto a low maintenance balcony overlooking the courtyard with a highly sought after south facing orientation making it the perfect sun trap on them long sunny summer evenings whilst the front provides ample parking on a peaceful cul de sac. A major bonus of this property is the expansive attic space, which has been fully floored and fitted with a Stira folding staircase to provide substantial extra storage.\r\n\r\nNo. 10 comes to the market in great condition throughout having been lovingly maintained by its current owners with no expense spared when upgrading in recent years, it has been freshly renovated over the years with fresh painting, new flooring and top-quality fixtures & fittings. These duplex apartments are exceptionally spacious and offer a lengthy list of striking features such as double-glazed windows, gas fired central heating, ample parking and sunny south facing balcony to name but a few. Mixed interest is sure to be seen from a wide range of buyers such as first-time buyers looking to get on the property ladder, investors looking to capitalise on the strong rents in the area and people looking to downsize. \r\n\r\nRegister your interest today with Ray Cooke Auctioneers. \r\n\r\nAdditional Features; \r\n- c. 110 sqm \r\n- BER B3\r\n- Management fees c. 1,900 per annum \r\n- 3 bed 3 bath \r\n- Duplex apartment \r\n- End of terrace duplex with more light \r\n- Floored attic space with Stira stairs for excellent additional storage\r\n- Permits available for up to two cars\r\n- Superbly maintained \r\n- Great condition throughout\r\n- Tastefully decorated from top to bottom \r\n- Freshly renovated in recent years \r\n- Double glazed & PVC\r\n- Top quality blinds \r\n- Gas fired central heating\r\n- Self-cleaning heating system \r\n- Entrance hallway \r\n- Fully fitted kitchen \r\n- Large open plan living/dining area \r\n- Sun room to the rear \r\n- Landing leads to all rooms \r\n- Three double bedrooms \r\n- Master ensuite \r\n- Built in wardrobes \r\n- Main family bathroom \r\n- Sunny south facing balcony & sun room to the rear\r\n- Plenty of natural sunlight \r\n- Stira stairs to attic \r\n- Floored for additional storage \r\n- Top quality flooring throughout \r\n- Overlooking courtyard to rear \r\n- Ample parking\r\n- X2 designated parking permits \r\n- Overground and underground parking \r\n- Located on highly sought-after road\r\n- Located on peaceful cul de sac \r\n- Luas stop within 5 minutes' walk \r\n- Citywest shopping centre on your doorstep \r\n- M50 & N7 within easy reach \r\n- Viewing highly advised \r\n\r\nDirections\r\nFrom the Naas Road take Exit 3 for Citywest. At the roundabout at the top of the slip road turn right. Proceed straight ahead until you reach the City West Shopping Centre and at this roundabout continue along and turn left onto Carrigmore Elms and proceed straight ahead then turn right onto Carrigmore Manor then right again onto Carrigmore Terrace where number 10 will be on the right."
      },
